-你们认识对方  -对
- What, do you two know each other? - Yeah.

78
00:02:15,560 --> 00:02:16,290
怎么认识的
How?

79
00:02:18,360 --> 00:02:21,390
我们偶遇  喝醉  我朝他脑袋蹦了一枪
We met. We drank. I shot him in the head.

80
00:02:21,560 --> 00:02:23,080
你怎么还戴着那玩意
Why are you still wearing that thing?

81
00:02:23,430 --> 00:02:25,400
-这...  -好了  他说我们可以留下
- It's-- - Okay. He says we can stay.

82
00:02:25,430 --> 00:02:27,520
-你跟他说了什么  -我只是亮出了黑卡
- What did you tell him? - Uh, I just gave him my black card,

83
00:02:27,520 --> 00:02:29,310
答应他付半年的房租
agreed to pay the rent for the next six months.

84
00:02:30,500 --> 00:02:32,990
-我是丹尼  -杰西卡
- Hey, I'm, uh... I'm Danny. - Jessica.

85
00:02:33,850 --> 00:02:36,770
-你是...  -不  我不来这一套
- And, uh... you are? - No, I can't. I'm not doing this.

86
00:02:36,780 --> 00:02:38,060
-哪一套  -不管刚才发生了什么
- Doing what? - Whatever happened back there,

87
00:02:38,060 --> 00:02:39,770
我们是万不得已  我们活着逃出来了
we did what we had to. We got out alive.

88
00:02:39,770 --> 00:02:41,570
我们越少了解彼此  这样越好
The less we know about each other, the better.

89
00:02:41,580 --> 00:02:43,510
-事态已经太过头了  -好了
- This is... It's too much already. - Okay.

90
00:02:43,510 --> 00:02:44,860
-别  -天啊
