- What are they really called? - No, he's... he's right.

95
00:02:54,910 --> 00:02:56,370
你之前遇到过他们
You crossed paths with them before?

96
00:02:56,430 --> 00:02:57,700
-对  -什么时候
- Yeah. - When?

97
00:02:58,420 --> 00:03:00,530
-这不重要  -不重要个屁
- It doesn't matter. - Bullshit it doesn't matter.

98
00:03:00,530 --> 00:03:02,540
-我同意  -我们得想清楚下一步怎么办
