也没有"我们"  他们追杀我们  我们逃脱
And there is no "We." They came at us, we fought our way out.

101
00:03:07,020 --> 00:03:08,980
这叫职业礼仪  就这样
Let's call it professional courtesy. End of story.

102
00:03:08,980 --> 00:03:10,100
事情没那么简单
Look, it's not that simple.

103
00:03:10,100 --> 00:03:13,030
-这些人很危险  -我也是
- These people, they're dangerous. - So am I.

104
00:03:13,110 --> 00:03:16,410
谁快点告诉我手和会到底是怎么回事
