那是什么
What is that?

107
00:03:19,840 --> 00:03:21,260
那是...
Oh. Um, as, uh...

108
00:03:21,260 --> 00:03:24,350
协议的一部分  他给我做了四人份的菜
as part of the deal, he made me order four of everything.

109
00:03:24,390 --> 00:03:25,870
我们不是来吃饭的
We're not here to eat.

110
00:03:27,490 --> 00:03:30,100
-那是猪肉吗  -不  是虾
- Uh, are those pork? - No, they're shrimp.

111
00:03:31,360 --> 00:03:34,050
-这个人端的是猪肉  -太好了
- Oh. This guy's got pork. - Ah, great!

112
00:03:35,500 --> 00:03:36,530
天啊  你真怪
God, you're weird.

113
00:03:37,960 --> 00:03:40,560
手和会是个古老的犯罪组织
The Hand is an ancient criminal organization.

114
