115
00:03:42,420 --> 00:03:44,810
-他们永远存在  -你想再尝一口吗
- They live forever. - You wanna try that again?

116
00:03:44,810 --> 00:03:46,570
他们信奉狂热信仰
They live by a fanatical ideology,

117
00:03:46,570 --> 00:03:48,030
并且每个成员都誓死保卫它
and every member is willing to die to protect it.

118
00:03:48,030 --> 00:03:49,550
-所以他们是恐怖分子  -不
- So they're terrorists? - No.

119
00:03:49,550 --> 00:03:50,820
恐怖分子想让全世界知道他们的行径
Terrorists want the world to know what they're doing.

120
00:03:50,820 --> 00:03:53,440
而他们更隐秘  更邪恶
This is something more secret, more evil.

121
00:03:53,440 --> 00:03:54,560
他们遍布全球
And they're global.

122
00:03:54,810 --> 00:03:56,930
-他们具体做什么  -什么都做
- So what do they do? - Everything.

123
00:03:56,930 --> 00:03:58,680
包括在哈莱姆招募年轻人
Including the recruitment of young men in Harlem?

124
00:03:58,680 --> 00:03:59,530
显然
Apparently.

125
00:03:59,530 --> 00:04:01,440
他们来纽约是有原因的  但我不知道是什么
They're in New York for a reason, but I don't know why.

126
00:04:01,440 --> 00:04:03,350
-"狂热信仰"是什么意思  -真离谱
