And I think they want me.

130
00:04:11,520 --> 00:04:12,840
-为了你的钱  -不
- For your money? - No.

131
00:04:15,130 --> 00:04:16,580
我是不朽铁拳
I'm the Immortal Iron Fist.

132
00:04:17,200 --> 00:04:18,040
什么玩意
Come again?

133
00:04:18,250 --> 00:04:19,830
昆仑的忠实守护者
Sworn protector of K'un-Lun.

134
00:04:20,170 --> 00:04:21,270
你嗑什么了  锂盐吗
What are you on? Lithium?

135
00:04:21,270 --> 00:04:23,510
那个拿剑的女人是谁
So, who was the woman with the swords?

136
00:04:23,780 --> 00:04:27,100
我不确定  不过我在柬埔寨和她交过手
Look, I'm not sure, but I fought her in Cambodia.

137
00:04:27,100 --> 00:04:28,430
对  她在我家门口出现过
Yeah, and she showed up at my doorstep.

138
